"Mucho gusto" is fine. Here's what sounds even more natural 👋
Guys say "encantado," girls say "encantada."

Today's phrases:
• mucho gusto = nice to meet you
• encantado / encantada = delighted
• el gusto es mío = the pleasure is mine

